  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_1888.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>De mi&eacute;rcoles y jueves, primero en en auditorio de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda, con la incorporacion ya del cantante Pablo Pad&iacute;n y la soprano Daniella Ratti, y ya bien pasada la medianoche en el recinto multiusos, que acoge la noche de este viernes el concierto, a partir delas 23 horas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1724.jpg\" alt=\"img_1724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1725.jpg\" alt=\"img_1725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1726.jpg\" alt=\"img_1726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1728.jpg\" alt=\"img_1728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1729.jpg\" alt=\"img_1729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1730.jpg\" alt=\"img_1730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1731.jpg\" alt=\"img_1731\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1732.jpg\" alt=\"img_1732\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segonitercerassaigqueen/img_1734.jpg\" alt=\"img_1734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;